# Documentation Directory

This directory contains comprehensive planning and technical documentation for the Lux Depth V3 integration.

## Planning Documents

### Feature Integration
- **DA3_FEATURE_GAP_ANALYSIS.md** - Detailed analysis of missing features from official DA3 repo
- **DA3_FEATURE_INTEGRATION_TRACKER.md** - Implementation roadmap and task tracking
- **DA3_FEATURE_DECISION_MATRIX.md** - Quick reference decision framework

### Technical Reference
- **API_REFERENCE.md** - Complete API documentation
- **CLI_INTEGRATION.md** - CLI wrapper implementation details
- **BENCHMARK.md** - Evaluation metrics and dataset documentation
- **REFERENCE_VIEW_SELECTION.md** - Reference view strategy documentation

### Implementation History
- **DA3_CLI_INTEGRATION_COMPLETE.md** - CLI integration completion summary

## Document Status

All documents are version-controlled and reviewed by the Transformation Portal Architect.

